# NPC platform pairing

This repo is part of a **three-repo platform** with `NPC-Chat-Middleware` (Python), `NPC-Yaml-Editor-CSharp` (C#), and `NPC-Narrator-Discord-Bot` (TypeScript).

## Architecture (do not violate)

```text
Browser / Discord bot
        → NPC-Yaml-Editor-CSharp (auth, UI, pairing, sessions, SignalR)
        → HTTP proxy
        → NPC-Chat-Middleware (game logic)
```

- Discord bot and browsers reach middleware only through the Yaml Editor proxy — never call middleware directly for game traffic from the bot.

## Git (required)

Follow **git-branch-and-pr-workflow** in this repo: branch off `main`, **commit on the feature branch before finishing**, never commit to `main`, open PRs with `--base main`. Use the same branch slug across affected repos for paired work.

When changing API routes, proxy behavior, DM/voice flows, JSON contracts, or audio format:

1. Check the other repository(ies) for callers/implementations.
2. Use the **npc-platform-coordinator** skill for branch + paired PR workflow.
3. Read yaml-editor `docs/MIDDLEWARE_INTEGRATION.md` before contract changes.

